<title>CHINA: TRADING IN GREAT WALL ELEC SUSPENDED.</title>
<headline>TRADING IN GREAT WALL ELEC SUSPENDED.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Great Wall Electronic International Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong Stock Exchange said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Great Wall shares rose HK$0.22 to end at HK$1.17 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company makes electronic consumer products.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6370</p>
